  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c73279f988907169b5fe6a873bf7413b8d79e8a550050c377f8982fb02280e9f",
      "text": "悟空的\n热闹午觉",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eea8055b3df5bb6a99b98687e3e8446491b357f3e783f37e6d8da9c9d6d91e91",
      "text": "悟空打了个大哈欠。\n“该睡午觉啦！”\n他来到桃树下，凉快极了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e2f570d8cafc40caedda1737f1e2261a7498bacd9ccaf22d2987dc45c2f44214",
      "text": "八戒抱来一个枕头。\n“像云朵一样软！”\n接着，他的肚子\n咕噜咕噜叫。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a9496f24ab01abad6e6a8f3f359ede1e0597092660958f9701a27b3523016d53",
      "text": "“先吃点心吧。”悟空说。\n吧唧，吧唧。\n八戒的肚子安静啦。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6245e2900cf32483f79449ba94c670848686d632f6aa19252661d9b46a9d4c6",
      "text": "沙僧拿着大叶子，\n慢慢地扇呀扇。\n叶子蹭到了悟空的鼻子。\n“啊……啊……阿嚏！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "947d44302006986c226fdb22d9a4a3554ba329e19655139788d207afbdbc5e74",
      "text": "一只小鸟唱起歌。\n“啾啾！啾啾！”\n悟空坐了起来。\n“小声一点，好吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e5f90e2a6b1b0c3b7ff0f813267b934e47c8bad2f674c99390b1a2fd1efdfe89",
      "text": "八戒轻轻地嚼，\n沙僧慢慢地扇，\n小鸟小声唱：“啾……啾……”\n悟空笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "326923f36d23658d139440faf787c2960441bdd54adb67b72a05471eb649437d",
      "text": "悟空轻轻吹了口气。\n一朵小云绕着他的脚转圈。\n“这下舒服啦。”\n他小声说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "240db07f1bdab79835b193f3bc89d4074532ccb9c6b1c3d837f3db7191c765a5",
      "text": "很快，朋友们也困了。\n八戒打起呼噜：“呼噜……”\n悟空忍不住又笑了一声。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "13fa9cdebcd76dc868bd79e442084b0b1d67c73893efab214e8a9716af662e92",
      "text": "桃树下，\n大家都睡着了。\n树叶沙沙轻响，\n云朵慢慢飘过。\n小英雄也得睡午觉呀。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
